It contains no third-party source code. At run time it can use, without bundling them:
  OpenCV (Apache-2.0), NumPy (BSD-3-Clause), pandas (BSD-3-Clause), PyYAML (MIT), Matplotlib (Matplotlib License),
  and optionally PyTorch (BSD-3-Clause), Kornia (Apache-2.0) and LightGlue with its DISK and SIFT weights (Apache-2.0).

Results in this repository are computed on images from VisA (CC BY 4.0, Zou et al., ECCV 2022) and MVTec AD
(CC BY-NC-SA 4.0, Bergmann et al., CVPR 2019). Pictures in report/ are made from VisA images (CC BY 4.0); no MVTec AD
image, and no picture made from one, is included. The landmark files in annotations/ are made on VisA images and are
licensed CC BY 4.0 (credit: Kai Xuan).
